      "result_description": "Roche Old Boys CC - 2nd XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "68117",
      "match_notes": "Roche won the toss and decided to bat first on a sunny day at the RCG, racking up 349-9 off their 45 overs, J Inch (105) scoring his maiden hundred for the club was supported well by I Trudgeon 87 n/o, T Hall 41, T Trudgeon 36 and 13 year old H Gregory with 28 n/o.<br>In reply Duloe got off to a quick start, but lost regular wickets, and were bowled out in the 25th over for 119, A Conway 22 and E Coley with 20 for the visitors, D Jeffery 4-18, L Oakley 3-29 and T Trudgeon 2-47 doing the damage for Roche to earn a 230 run win!",
